  "description": "🏡 A beautiful collection of cozy autumn house watercolor clipart featuring charming American suburban homes, welcoming front porches, seasonal outdoor décor, and elegant fall landscaping. Designed in a soft modern watercolor style with warm autumn colors, smooth painterly gradients, and simplified architectural details, this collection captures the inviting atmosphere of cozy neighborhoods during the fall season.\n✨ Perfect for:\n• Print on Demand products\n• Stickers and sticker sheets\n• Scrapbooking projects\n• Journals and planners\n• Greeting cards and invitations\n• Packaging and branding projects\n• Social media graphics\n• Digital and printable crafts\n• Autumn and Thanksgiving designs\n• Seasonal home décor projects\n🤍 What’s included:\n– 20 high-quality illustrations\n– White background\n– High resolution – 300 DPI (perfect for print & digital use)\n– 20 PNG files\n– 20 SVG files\n🏡 Included illustrations:\nwhite Colonial house, red farmhouse, modern Craftsman house, brick suburban house, blue cottage, cozy front porch, backyard patio, wooden cabin, Cape Cod house, stone cottage, corner porch with rocking chairs, autumn house entrance, decorative pumpkin arrangement, wooden porch bench, autumn maple tree, front door décor set, vintage wheelbarrow with pumpkins, American mailbox decorated for fall, lantern and chrysanthemum display, wooden welcome sign etc.\n✨ Inspired by American suburban neighborhoods, cozy front porches, pumpkin season, fall decorating traditions, autumn gardens, harvest festivals, crisp mornings, colorful maple trees, welcoming home entrances, and seasonal outdoor living. These illustrations are perfect for creating warm, inviting, and timeless autumn-themed designs with a modern watercolor aesthetic.",
  "fullDescription": "<p>🏡 A beautiful collection of cozy autumn house watercolor clipart featuring charming American suburban homes, welcoming front porches, seasonal outdoor décor, and elegant fall landscaping. Designed in a soft modern watercolor style with warm autumn colors, smooth painterly gradients, and simplified architectural details, this collection captures the inviting atmosphere of cozy neighborhoods during the fall season.</p>\n<p>✨ Perfect for:</p>\n<p>• Print on Demand products<br>\n• Stickers and sticker sheets<br>\n• Scrapbooking projects<br>\n• Journals and planners<br>\n• Greeting cards and invitations<br>\n• Packaging and branding projects<br>\n• Social media graphics<br>\n• Digital and printable crafts<br>\n• Autumn and Thanksgiving designs<br>\n• Seasonal home décor projects</p>\n<p>🤍 What’s included:</p>\n<p>– 20 high-quality illustrations<br>\n– White background<br>\n– High resolution – 300 DPI (perfect for print &amp; digital use)<br>\n– 20 PNG files<br>\n– 20 SVG files</p>\n<p>🏡 Included illustrations:</p>\n<p>white Colonial house, red farmhouse, modern Craftsman house, brick suburban house, blue cottage, cozy front porch, backyard patio, wooden cabin, Cape Cod house, stone cottage, corner porch with rocking chairs, autumn house entrance, decorative pumpkin arrangement, wooden porch bench, autumn maple tree, front door décor set, vintage wheelbarrow with pumpkins, American mailbox decorated for fall, lantern and chrysanthemum display, wooden welcome sign etc.</p>\n<p>✨ Inspired by American suburban neighborhoods, cozy front porches, pumpkin season, fall decorating traditions, autumn gardens, harvest festivals, crisp mornings, colorful maple trees, welcoming home entrances, and seasonal outdoor living. These illustrations are perfect for creating warm, inviting, and timeless autumn-themed designs with a modern watercolor aesthetic.</p>",
